config DRM_MEDIATEK_V2
	bool "chopin: vendor mediatek_v2 display stack (MT6895-Mainline approach)"
	depends on DRM && DRM_MEDIATEK
	help
	  Build the vendor mediatek_v2 display driver imported for the chopin
	  port, the way MT6895-Mainline/linux does for xaga.  When enabled, the
	  upstream mediatek-drm object list must not be built (see the Makefile
	  gate), because both claim the same DT nodes.
